{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n張敬軒即將於澳門倫敦人舉行跨年演唱會，未料昨日優先訂票即引發15萬人塞爆系統搶購。原本1,780元套票更被瘋狂炒高至1.5萬天價，讓大批忠實歌迷苦不堪言。一票難求加上黃牛猖獗情況，逼使主辦方必須緊急採取驚人舉動。\n</p>\n<h2>張敬軒澳門騷15萬人排隊搶飛</h2>\n<p>昨日歌迷會內部預購率先展開，網絡售票系統史無前例錄得接近15萬名會員同時排隊輪候，原定6場演出瞬間爆滿。今日轉戰公開發售階段，搶飛熱潮再度急速升溫，8場門票全數遭到秒殺。市場上隨即湧現大量疑似黃牛黨放售門票，將原價1,780元套票惡意抬高至1.5萬元出售，若以單張票價計算炒價足足飆升4至5倍。</p>\n<h2>澳門倫敦人主辦方兩日兩度加場</h2>\n<p>面對一票難求與黃牛肆虐情況，主辦單位火速調整策略應對龐大購票需求。團隊昨日率先加開12月27日及明年1月3日兩場演出，今日見勢頭未減再落實加開1月9日及10日兩場，短短兩日間將總場次由最初6場大幅增至10場。新增場次門票將於明日率先開放予歌迷會優先認購，下星期再作公開發售，務求讓樂迷能以正價入場。</p>\n<h2>盛樂演唱會歌迷掀起瘋狂搶購潮</h2>\n<p>這場《澳門倫敦人榮譽呈獻：張敬軒 x 澳門中樂團 Unplugged．盛樂演唱會》屬於聖誕節及元旦黃金檔期，向來是各大歌手必爭之地，加上長假期效應自然吸引大量外地粉絲提早預備行程。過往同類大型跨年演出往往極速售罄，今次舞台更特別結合中樂團元素，獨特編排進一步推高期待值。市場對這類高質素節慶表演需求龐大，造成門票供不應求現象，導致黃牛黨伺機大規模入貨圖利。</p>\n<h2>大批忠實樂迷湧入社交平台吐苦水</h2>\n<p>即使大會已經盡力增加供應，無數向隅歌迷依然滿腔怒火，紛紛湧入各大社交平台留言表達不滿。有網民無奈表示「chok極都chok唔到飛」，亦有人大呻「全部”缺貨登記” 有冇神人買到？」。面對公開發售極速售罄，大批粉絲激動直斥「1分鐘就話冇？？不如直接唔好賣」，同時也有不少擁躉強烈要求「終極加10場, please!!!」。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179318546852045129_18520323036ae1d6bd291bb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"londoner flip 9-10 JAN_1027_1080x1080_8.jpg/4500x4500_q90.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179318546852045129_18520323036ae1d6bd291bb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：大會提供）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179318547627793112_834356166ae1d6c4a29dd.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"IMG_9174.PNG/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179318547627793112_834356166ae1d6c4a29dd.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：網站截圖）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179318547938277330_898780096ae1d6c7cb0f9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"f4bc99ae-6dc6-4992-9313-f8d4b503e95f.JPG/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179318547938277330_898780096ae1d6c7cb0f9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179318548121083176_13952744966ae1d6c9a7188.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"5293b116-1c78-46ed-9bb7-c1eb1600bdea.JPG/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179318548121083176_13952744966ae1d6c9a7188.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179318548264540491_8404938646ae1d6cb1346a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"02ac1b3f-685e-4f21-8e77-28eaf0f80602.JPG/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179318548264540491_8404938646ae1d6cb1346a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T11:21:23.387735+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1087,"images":5,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T11:04:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T13:38:42.631356+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T11:18:32.242524+00:00","content_hash":"17dfe977db10016fdde468af2b35f67725bd64b7208efbda7c77823a0494f1ee","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}